\meta{toc}{true}

\p{
    Named systems, each a particular choice of [arithmetisation](dhsorens-002R), [commitment](dhsorens-002Z), and field. Once the layers below are understood these should be readable as combinations rather than as separate inventions — and where a system is not just a combination, that is the interesting part.
}

